    <ecd:MtrlTermsOfTrdArrTextBlock contextRef="c-550" id="f-1980">John L. Hennessy, Chair of the Board of Directors of Alphabet Inc., through the John L. Hennessy &amp;amp; Andrea J. Hennessy Revocable Trust, terminated a trading plan on June 22, 2026, that was originally adopted on November 10, 2025. The trading plan was scheduled to remain in effect until March 15, 2027. The plan provided for the potential sale of up to an aggregate of 8,400 shares of Class C Capital Stock and 4,200 shares of Class A Common Stock.</ecd:MtrlTermsOfTrdArrTextBlock>
    <ecd:TrdArrIndName contextRef="c-550" id="f-1979">John L. Hennessy</ecd:TrdArrIndName>
    <ecd:TrdArrIndTitle contextRef="c-550" id="f-1981">Chair of the Board of Directors</ecd:TrdArrIndTitle>
